    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Sorry for the delay.<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m not 100% sure I understand exactly what you&#39;re saying, but from the sounds of it you need:</div><div><br></div><div>1. Move away from reactiveValues and observeEvent where possible. Watch/do the &quot;Effective Reactive Programming&quot; tutorial vids <a href=\"https://www.rstudio.com/resources/webinars/shiny-developer-conference/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.rstudio.com/resources/webinars/shiny-developer-conference/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390916491000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Ct8F5GaYekfoW7oAby3zp\">here</a> (sorry, it&#39;s a couple of hours--but I think you will save a lot of time in the long run).</div><div>2. Use <a href=\"https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/modules.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/modules.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390916491000&amp;usg=AOvVaw20BNI9VmMHhW-6beBICjDW\">Shiny Modules</a>, they&#39;re exactly intended for this purpose.</div><div>3. Figure out how to wire up the Shiny modules to each other. I haven&#39;t (yet) done a great job of documenting this kind of thing but you&#39;ll essentially want:</div><div><br></div><div># in the server function</div><div>filtered &lt;- callModule(selectorModule, &quot;selector&quot;, reactive(predat))</div><div>callModule(preModule, &quot;pre&quot;, filtered)</div><div>callModule(diffModule, &quot;diff&quot;, filtered)</div><div>callModule(crossCorrModule, &quot;crossCor&quot;, filtered)</div><div><br></div><div>where the selectorModule server function is something like:</div><div><br></div><div>selectorModule &lt;- function(input, output, session, fullData) {</div><div>  filteredData &lt;- reactive({</div><div>    df &lt;- fullData()</div><div>    # I&#39;m imagining a checkbox for filtering instead</div><div>    if (input$filter) {</div><div>      df &lt;- df[1:40,]</div><div>    }</div><div>    df</div><div>  })</div><div><br></div><div>  output$table &lt;- renderTable(filteredData())</div><div><br></div><div>  return(filteredData)</div><div>}<br><br>The fundamental idea is that you pass reactive expressions back and forth between modules. By passing and returning them by name (i.e. &quot;filteredData&quot; instead of &quot;filteredData()&quot;) it&#39;s like passing a reference to the reactive expression itself, rather than just passing the current value of a reactive expression.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Friday, December 30, 2016 at 2:11:44 PM UTC-8, Sviatoslav Kendall wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>I&#39;m developing a shiny app in which there are multiple tabs displaying widget-modifiable analyses of a single dataset. In the interest of modularity, I&#39;ve written scripts for each tab&#39;s UI and SERVER code which are sourced within the actual ui.R and server.R scripts. I&#39;ve also written two global scripts:<div><br></div><div>- graphs.R which defines functions for displaying analyses</div><div>- key_columns.R which defines lists of column names (pairing front and back end names for each column); the lists also separate columns according to which drop-down menus they appear in</div><div><br></div><div>I want to create a new tab that displays the dataset and allows the users to apply filters to subset it. In the UI that I created for this purpose, there are two buttons that:</div><div>- Apply Filters to subset the dataset; (currently it just replaces the reactiveValue dataframe with a truncated version but the idea is that it will apply user-defined filters to the reactiveValue dataframe)</div><div>- Clear Filters return the dataset to its original, full, un-filtered status</div><div><br></div><div><b>The problem is that when the &quot;Apply Filters&quot; button is pressed, it does not appear to have any effect. My best guess is that this is a scoping issue relating to the fact that the ui.R script only gets run once and so even though each tab has dynamic widgets that alter the display of the page based on user-input, the ui.R only ever sees the original version of the dataframe no matter what filters are applied.</b> <b>I suspect that I can solve the problem by either:<br></b></div><div><b><br>- re-writing the app such that each supporting function checks to see if it should apply any filters to the full dataframe</b></div><div><b>- changing the scoping somehow to make each tab &quot;subservient&quot; to the tab where the filters get applied (which is what I originally thought would be accomplished by using <i>reactiveValues()</i> in concert with <i>observeEvent()</i> )<br><br></b></div><div><b>Am I on the right track to solving this? Am I missing something important?</b></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Here are my ui.R and server.R scripts:</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\"># UI.R</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plotly</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">Cairo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># SOURCE IN SCRIPTS FOR EACH TAB&#39;S UI</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pre_UI.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;diff_UI.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;cross_UI.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;selector_UI.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># THIS IS THE TAB WHERE DATASET FILTERS ARE SUPPOSED TO BE APPLIED</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>options</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bitmapType</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;cairo&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># DEFINE UI FOR EACH TAB BASED ON FUNCTION DEFINED IN IT&#39;S SCRIPT</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>pre_ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> createPreTabUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>diff_ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> createDiffTabUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>cross_ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> createCrossTabUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>selector_ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> createSelectorTabUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># HEADER</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>hPanel </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> headerPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># LOTS OF TEXT, WORKS FINE, NOT RELEVANT TO MY QUESTION</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">navbarPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;BMS038&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           navbarMenu</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Genomics &amp; Outcome&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Pre-therapy&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pre_ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Change on therapy&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diff_ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Cross-therapy&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cross_ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>           tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Select Patients&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> selector_ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>           header</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hPanel<br>           </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Define UI for BMS-038 Companion website</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\"># SERVER.R</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">require</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">require</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plotly</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">require</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">survival</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">require</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#606\">GGally</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">require</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">require</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">gridExtra</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">require</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plotly</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># SOURCE IN SUPPORT SCRIPTS</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;key_columns.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;graphs.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pre_tab_logic.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;diff_tab_logic.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;cross_tab_logic.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>source</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;selector_tab_logic.R&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># THIS IS WHERE THE DATASET FILTERS ARE MEANT TO BE APPLIED</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># READ IN FILES</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>predat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">csv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pre_data_122016.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># REMOVE ON-TREATMENT SAMPLES</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>predat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> predat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">predat$SampleType </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pre&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># CHANGE myBOR TO FACTOR</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>predat$myBOR </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> factor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">predat$myBOR</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> levels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;PRCR&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;SD&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;PD&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ordered </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>full_dat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> predat<br>half_dat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> predat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">40</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>preondat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">csv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;pre_vs_on_data_122016.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># DIFFERENT DATASET; WILL EVENTUALLY WANT TO ALLOW THIS TO ALSO BE FILTERED</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># DEFINE SERVER LOGIC</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  values </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactiveValues</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">predat_1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> full_dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># SUBSET DATAFRAME WHEN BUTTON IS PRESSED</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$set_filter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    values$predat_1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> half_dat<br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># RESET DATAFRAME TO ITS FULL, UN-FILTERED STATE</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  observeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$clear_filter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    values$predat_1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> full_dat<br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  createPreTab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">values$predat_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  createDiffTab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> preondat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  createCrossCorrTab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> values$predat_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  createSelectorTab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> values$predat_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>I am happy to share code from the support scripts as needed; just wanted to avoid overwhelming you with too much at first in case there are crucial issues apparent in these two scripts.</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
